139			/// Loads a library from the given path, using the given manifest.
140			/// Does nothing if the library is already loaded.
141			/// Throws a LibraryLoadException if the library
142			/// cannot be loaded or does not have a Manifest.
143			/// If the library exports a function named "pocoInitializeLibrary",
144			/// this function is executed.
145			/// If called multiple times for the same library,
146			/// the number of calls to unloadLibrary() must be the same
147			/// for the library to become unloaded.
